## 9. Extract-components checklist

### Evidence gate

- [ ] `## Evidence` section filled with overall status + probe commands
- [ ] Every component row in section 2 cites a real probe command per score
- [ ] Tier 1 code excerpts verbatim from source (line numbers resolve in clone)
- [ ] Tier lists mirror `wiki/modules.md` section 7 exactly
- [ ] >=50% of references are `[verified]`

### Scoring

- [ ] Rubric (section 1) reviewed and accepted by stakeholder
- [ ] Each criterion scored 0-10 with rationale captured
- [ ] No ties broken arbitrarily (use heap or rule: prefer higher C1, then C3)

### Tiers

- [ ] Tier 1 components (>= 50) all have code excerpt + blockers
- [ ] Tier 2 components (40-49) all have promotion blockers
- [ ] Tier 3 components (< 40) all have one-line "why not"

### Recommendation

- [ ] Executive recommendation written for non-technical reader
- [ ] Effort estimate sums match person-day totals in deep-dive files
- [ ] Open questions listed

### Hand-off

- [ ] File committed to `dissects/<system>/extract/components.md`
- [ ] Tier list mirrors `wiki/modules.md` section 7
- [ ] Cross-link from `wiki/index.md`
- [ ] `neodoo-integrate` picks up Tier 1 list (if companion run)
- [ ] C3 scores read from `extract/license-audit.md` §6 (single source of truth)
- [ ] Cross-link to `extract/api.md` for any component with outbound HTTP
- [ ] Cross-link to `wiki/decisions.md` for components constrained by ADRs
- [ ] Cross-link to `risk-raw.md` for any component with severity ≥ high risk